#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:36
msgid "Extra Logging (periodic transfer stats)"
msgstr "额外日志记录（定期传输统计信息）"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:38
msgid ""
"Opt-in periodic INFO-level stats, aimed at watching a running server from"
" its logs without a metrics stack:"
msgstr "选择性地记录周期性 INFO 级别的统计信息，旨在通过日志监控正在运行的服务器，而无需使用指标堆栈："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:45
msgid ""
"Every interval, the server logs — per GPU — the L0<->L1 store/retrieve "
"activity of the last window and the cumulative totals since start "
"(operation count, tokens, size in GB, and average copy throughput in "
"GB/s):"
msgstr "每个时间间隔，服务器日志 — 每个 GPU — 记录最后窗口的 L0<->L1 存取活动和自启动以来的累计总数（操作计数、令牌、大小（GB）和平均复制吞吐量（GB/s）："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:54
msgid "The eviction loop also reports L1 memory usage at the same interval:"
msgstr "逐出循环还会在相同的时间间隔报告 L1 内存使用情况："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:60
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "注意："

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:62
msgid ""
"Transfer-stat lines are only emitted for windows with activity; the L1 "
"memory usage line is emitted every interval regardless of load."
msgstr "仅在有活动的窗口中发出传输状态行；L1 内存使用情况行在每个时间间隔内发出，无论负载如何。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:64
msgid ""
"``avg_copy`` measures throughput of the GPU-stream copy time only (not "
"wall clock), and shows ``n/a`` when no timed operation completed in the "
"window."
msgstr "``avg_copy`` 仅测量 GPU 流复制时间的吞吐量（不是实际时间），当窗口内没有完成计时操作时显示 ``n/a``。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:67
msgid ""
"``--extra-logging-interval`` values below ``1.0`` are limited by the 1 Hz"
" internal heartbeat."
msgstr "``--extra-logging-interval`` 小于 ``1.0`` 的值受限于 1 Hz 的内部心跳。"

#: ../../source/mp/observability/logs.rst:69
msgid ""
"``--enable-extra-logging`` works even with ``--disable-logging``, but "
"conflicts with ``--disable-observability`` (the server raises a "
"``ValueError`` at startup)."
msgstr "``--enable-extra-logging`` 即使在 ``--disable-logging`` 的情况下也能工作，但与 ``--disable-observability`` 冲突（服务器在启动时会引发 ``ValueError``）。"

